WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.499 --> 00:00:01.616
[VIDEO GAME BEEPING]

00:00:04.459 --> 00:00:06.750
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Storing
and querying massive datasets

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.530
can be time-consuming
and expensive

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.560
without the right hardware
and infrastructure.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.540
Google BigQuery is an
enterprise data warehouse

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.480
that solves this problem by
enabling super-fast SQL queries

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.300
using the processing power
of Google's infrastructure.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.090
In this episode, will go
over BigQuery Qwik Start,

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.890
a quick 30-minute lab
that introduces you

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.219
to Google BigQuery.

00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:26.010
You'll notice on Qwiklabs
that you can take

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.580
this lab in one of two ways.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.325
You can use the web UI
or the command line tool.

00:00:30.325 --> 00:00:32.700
Feel free to take the lab you
feel most comfortable with,

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.605
or take both if you
want to see how it

00:00:34.605 --> 00:00:36.600
would work in either scenario.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.510
In the lab, you'll
query a public dataset,

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.200
load custom data into a
table, create a new data set,

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.782
preview your table, and then
query your custom dataset.

00:00:46.782 --> 00:00:48.240
These labs are
designed to give you

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.698
a little taste of
the many features

00:00:49.698 --> 00:00:51.002
available within Google Cloud.

00:00:51.002 --> 00:00:53.460
Even if you've never used GCP
before, you can take this lab

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:54.960
and get started.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.680
Next up on our
quest is Bigtable--

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.290
Qwik Start a Command Line.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.910
A quest is a series
of related labs

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.160
that form a complete
learning path on Qwik Labs.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.930
Completing this quest
earns you this badge

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.580
to recognize your achievement.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.190
You'll be using a student GCP
account to work on these labs,

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.270
but if you're ready to
get your own GCP account,

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.920
here's $300 to get you started.

